SUMMARY:Jay Pharoah LIVE at Pittsburgh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260731T111853Z
DTSTART:20260731T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Jay Pharoah\nJay Pharoah
	 is one of the most talented comedians and impressionists of his generatio
	n\, best known for his seven seasons on Saturday Night Live where he becam
	e famous for his uncanny celebrity impressions. \nHis spot-on portrayals o
	f Will Smith\, Eddie Murphy\, Denzel Washington\, Kanye West\, and Barack 
	Obama made him a fan favorite and one of SNL’s most memorable cast members
	. Originally from Virginia\, Pharoah developed his comedy skills at local 
	clubs before touring the UK\, US\, and Montreal. \nBeyond impressions\, Ph
	aroah is a sharp stand-up comedian with high energy\, crowd work\, and sto
	rytelling that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Deta
	ils\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\
	nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120\nAge R
	estriction: 21+ Event\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAbout the
	 Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Improv is Pittsburgh’s premier comedy club\, locate
	d in the Waterfront entertainment complex in Homestead\, PA — just minutes
	 from downtown Pittsburgh. \nThe intimate showroom seats approximately 300
	 guests with excellent sightlines from every seat. A full-service bar and 
	restaurant are on-site\, with a two-drink minimum per person. \nFree parki
	ng is available throughout the Waterfront complex. Easily accessible via I
	-376 and Route 837. Arrive early to enjoy dinner before the show. \nWhat t
	o Expect\nJay Pharoah’s live show is a non-stop comedy experience blending
	 stand-up\, impressions\, and crowd interaction. \nExpect jaw-dropping cel
	ebrity impressions woven into hilarious original material. His ability to 
	transform into any celebrity on the spot is something that has to be seen 
	live to be believed. \nThe Pittsburgh Improv typically features a local op
	ener before the headliner takes the stage\, making for a complete evening 
	of comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $25 – $65 depending on
	 seating and availability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post co
	ntains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\
	n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-pharoah-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
	\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-pharoah-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, Pennsylvania\, 
	15120\, United States
