	uly 31)
DTSTAMP:20260731T111853Z
DTSTART:20260731T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nNate Bargatze is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, k
	nown for his clean\, relatable humor and masterful storytelling. Hailing f
	rom Old Hickory\, Tennessee\, Nate grew up in a household steeped in comed
	y — his father is a former clown turned magician\, which gave Nate a uniqu
	e perspective on performance from an early age. \nWith a style that blends
	 self-deprecating wit\, Southern charm\, and perfectly timed observations 
	about everyday life\, Nate has become a household name. He has appeared on
	 The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon multiple times\, released multiple
	 Netflix specials including The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest Average Ameri
	can\, and Hello World\, and sold out arenas across the country. \nHis Big 
	Dumb Eyes World Tour is his most ambitious tour yet — a massive arena run 
	that showcases why Nate Bargatze is considered one of the top stand-up com
	edians working today. Fans can expect his signature blend of slow-burn sto
	rytelling\, hilarious family anecdotes\, and the kind of comedy that makes
	 you laugh until your sides hurt. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 3
	1\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open approximately 6:00 PM)\nVenue: PP
	G Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Avenue\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15219\nPhone: (412) 6
	42-1800\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome\; content is clean and family-
	friendly\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nPPG 
	Paints Arena is Pittsburgh’s premier indoor entertainment venue\, located 
	in the heart of downtown Pittsburgh at 1001 Fifth Avenue. With a seating c
	apacity of approximately 18\,387\, it is one of the largest arenas in Penn
	sylvania and serves as the home of the Pittsburgh Penguins NHL team. \nThe
	 arena features state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, multiple con
	cession levels\, premium club seating\, and luxury suites. The venue is kn
	own for its excellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house\, 
	making it an ideal setting for large-scale comedy performances. The Lower 
	Level offers an intimate arena experience\, while the Upper Level provides
	 sweeping views of the entire stage. \nPPG Paints Arena is easily accessib
	le via public transit\, with multiple bus routes and the Light Rail (T) st
	opping nearby at Steel Plaza and Gateway stations. Parking is available in
	 several nearby garages including the Arena Parking Garage directly adjace
	nt to the venue. The arena is fully ADA accessible with dedicated seating 
	areas and accessible entrances throughout. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a sol
	o stand-up comedy performance by Nate Bargatze as part of his Big Dumb Eye
	s World Tour. The show will feature Nate performing his brand-new material
	 in a full arena setting\, complete with professional production\, lightin
	g\, and sound. \nNate’s shows are known for being incredibly welcoming to 
	all audiences — his clean comedy style means this is a perfect night out f
	or couples\, families\, and groups of friends alike. Expect an evening fil
	led with laugh-out-loud moments\, heartwarming stories\, and the kind of c
	omedy that stays with you long after the show ends. \nArrive early to find
	 your seats and grab concessions before the show begins. The arena fills u
	p quickly for Nate Bargatze performances\, so plan to arrive at least 30-4
	5 minutes before showtime. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $76 – $596+ 
	(resale prices vary) \nOfficial tickets are available through Ticketmaster
	. Resale tickets are available through VividSeats with all-in pricing and 
	a 100% Buyer Guarantee. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post conta
	ins affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\n
	https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-li
	ve-at-ppg-paints-arena-friday/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour
	-live-at-ppg-paints-arena-friday/
