SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Taft Theatre (Early Show)
DTSTAMP:20260731T111853Z
DTSTART:20260801T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n \nAbout the Pe
	rformer\nJosh Johnson is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best
	 known for his sharp wit\, absurdist observations\, and uniquely cerebral 
	comedic style. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\,
	 The Daily Show\, and his own Netflix special\, earning him a devoted fanb
	ase across the country. \nJohnson’s comedy blends intellectual humor with 
	relatable everyday experiences\, often exploring the quirks of modern life
	\, social dynamics\, and the human condition — all delivered with impeccab
	le timing and a laid-back confidence that keeps audiences laughing from st
	art to finish. \nHis Comedy Band Camp concept is a unique live experience 
	that combines stand-up performance with a musical\, camp-style atmosphere 
	— making it one of the most talked-about touring shows of 2026. \nEvent De
	tails\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nShow Time: 5:00 PM (Early Show)
	\nVenue: Taft Theatre\, 317 East 5th Street\, Cincinnati\, OH 45202\nDoors
	 Open: Approximately 4:00 PM\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome\; some co
	ntent may be intended for mature audiences\nNote: A second show (Late Show
	) is also available at 8:30 PM on the same date\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Ta
	ft Theatre is one of Cincinnati’s most beloved and historic entertainment 
	venues\, located in the heart of downtown at 317 East 5th Street. Built in
	 1928\, the Taft Theatre is a stunning example of Art Deco architecture an
	d has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy\, music\, and the perform
	ing arts for nearly a century. \nWith a seating capacity of approximately 
	2\,500\, the Taft offers an intimate yet grand atmosphere that makes every
	 seat feel close to the action. The venue features excellent sightlines\, 
	superior acoustics\, and a warm\, classic ambiance that enhances any live 
	performance experience. \nAmenities include a full-service bar\, concessio
	ns\, and accessible seating options. Parking is available in several nearb
	y garages and surface lots throughout downtown Cincinnati. The venue is al
	so conveniently accessible via public transit. \nWhat to Expect\nJosh John
	son’s Comedy Band Camp is not your average stand-up show. This unique live
	 experience brings together comedy\, music\, and an immersive camp-style a
	tmosphere that has been wowing audiences on tour across the country. \nExp
	ect a high-energy evening filled with Josh Johnson’s signature brand of sm
	art\, observational humor\, along with special musical elements that make 
	this show a one-of-a-kind event. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discover
	ing Josh Johnson for the first time\, this show promises to be an unforget
	table night of laughter and entertainment. \nThe Early Show at 5:00 PM is 
	perfect for those who want to enjoy the full experience and still have the
	 rest of the evening free. Arrive early to grab a drink\, find your seat\,
	 and soak in the incredible atmosphere of the historic Taft Theatre. \nTic
	ket Information\nTickets for Josh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp (Early Show) 
	at Taft Theatre start from approximately $89\, with premium options availa
	ble at higher price points. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (of
	ficial) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Ti
	ckets\n \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at 
	no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-co
	medy-band-camp-live-at-taft-theatre-early-show/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at
	-taft-theatre-early-show/
LOCATION:Taft Theatre\, 317 East 5th Street\, Cincinnati\, Ohio\, 45202\, U
	nited States
