SUMMARY:Adam Ray: WHO IS ME Tour LIVE at San Jose Improv
DTSTAMP:20260731T111854Z
DTSTART:20260801T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nAdam Ray
	 is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian\, actor\, and podcaster best kno
	wn for his uncanny celebrity impressions and razor-sharp observational hum
	or. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\, Conan\, an
	d The Late Late Show with James Corden\, and is widely recognized for his 
	viral Dr. Phil impression that has amassed tens of millions of views onlin
	e. \nBeyond stand-up\, Adam is the host of the wildly popular podcast Abou
	t Last Night\, where he interviews celebrities and fellow comedians in his
	 signature unfiltered style. His comedy blends pop culture commentary\, se
	lf-deprecating humor\, and spot-on impressions that leave audiences in sti
	tches from start to finish. \nThe WHO IS ME Tour is Adam Ray’s latest head
	line touring show — a fully realized stand-up hour that dives deep into hi
	s personal life\, Hollywood observations\, and the absurdity of modern exi
	stence. Fans can expect a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud performance packed 
	with new material and crowd-pleasing moments. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sat
	urday\, August 1\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue
	: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction:
	 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nContent: Adult language and themes\nTwo-it
	em minimum purchase required in the showroom\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San J
	ose Improv is one of the Bay Area’s premier comedy clubs\, located in the 
	heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. Part of the nationally renow
	ned Improv Comedy Club chain\, the San Jose location has hosted some of th
	e biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe intimate club-style 
	venue seats approximately 250 guests in a general admission\, first-come-f
	irst-served format\, with premium booth and table options available for th
	ose seeking a more elevated experience. The layout ensures that every seat
	 in the house offers an excellent sightline to the stage\, creating an up-
	close and personal comedy experience. \nThe venue features a full bar and 
	food menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom. P
	arking is available in nearby downtown San Jose garages and street parking
	. The club is easily accessible via public transit\, just steps from the S
	an Jose Diridon Station area and downtown light rail stops. \nWhat to Expe
	ct\nAdam Ray’s WHO IS ME Tour is a solo headline stand-up show featuring a
	pproximately 75-90 minutes of new material. The show is a full evening of 
	comedy — no opening act filler\, just Adam Ray delivering his best work in
	 an intimate club setting. \nExpect a mix of celebrity impression segments
	\, personal storytelling\, and sharp observational comedy. Adam’s high-ene
	rgy stage presence and natural crowd interaction make every show feel uniq
	ue and spontaneous. This is a 21+ event\, so the material is unfiltered an
	d adult-oriented. \nSeating is general admission\, so arriving early is re
	commended to secure the best seats. Premium VIP booths and tables are avai
	lable for purchase and include food and beverage credits. \nTicket Informa
	tion\nPrice Range: $37.17 – $107.72 (includes fees) \nTickets are availabl
	e through official channels and resale platforms. Purchase early as this s
	how is expected to sell out. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis po
	st contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets 
	through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show tim
	es subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps:/
	/comedycalendar.com/event/adam-ray-who-is-me-tour-live-at-san-jose-improv/
	\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/adam-ray-who-is-me-tour-live-at-san-jo
	se-improv/
