DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nCristela Alonzo: The 
	Midlife Mixtape Tour LIVE at Brea Improv\nHistoric comedian and actress Cr
	istela Alonzo brings her “Midlife Mixtape Tour” to the Brea Improv for a w
	eekend run of shows in August 2026. \nThe first Latina to create\, produce
	\, and star in her own network sitcom\, Cristela Alonzo is a trailblazer i
	n comedy and entertainment. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2
	026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddres
	s: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: Gener
	al Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase re
	quired \nAbout Cristela Alonzo\nCristela Alonzo is a comedian\, actress\, 
	and writer who became the first Latina to create\, produce\, and star in h
	er own network sitcom with ABC’s Cristela. She is also known for voicing C
	ruz Ramirez in Pixar’s Cars 3 and has released stand-up specials on Netfli
	x. Her comedy draws from her experiences growing up in a Mexican-American 
	family on the Texas-Mexico border. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up 
	about midlife\, family\, and cultural identity\nMaterial from her acclaime
	d Netflix specials\nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\nMultiple sho
	w times available Saturday and Sunday\n21+ show with full bar and two-item
	 minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd i
	n Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange Coun
	ty\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficia
	l Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contain
	s affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through ou
	r links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject
	 to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycal
	endar.com/event/cristela-alonzo-the-midlife-mixtape-tour-live-at-brea-impr
	ov/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/cristela-alonzo-the-midlife-mixtape-to
	ur-live-at-brea-improv/
