	e Pass (The Showroom)\nAddress: 5040 Wild Horse Pass Blvd\, Chandler\, AZ 
	85226\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event\nParking: Available on-site at the resor
	t \nAbout Jo Koy\nJo Koy is one of today’s premier stand-up comedians\, kn
	own for his hilarious and heartfelt storytelling about his Filipino-Americ
	an family and upbringing. He has sold out arenas worldwide\, released mult
	iple Netflix specials\, and is beloved by millions of fans for his relatab
	le humor and infectious energy. His tours consistently rank among the top-
	grossing comedy tours in the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stan
	d-up comedy from one of the world’s top comedians\nHilarious stories about
	 family\, culture\, and everyday life\nAn intimate showroom setting at a w
